WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
+200 % supplier bankruptcies in H1 2024
Source: Resilinc, via SDCExec (2024)

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Aura Supply spots the single-source item in the Maison Lucie demo.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Time to recover exceeds time to survive: an 11-day gap, €179k of margin exposed.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
One click on “Decide”: the decision arrives pre-filled from the alert.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Aura Decide compares the options and shows what would change the choice.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Result: an explained decision, “why it holds”, and a PDF mini-report.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Aura Supply, with Decide built in. See it coming, understand, decide, and prove it.
